  "title": "Apple's App Tracking Transparency Policy Changes in Response to German Competition",
  "summary": "Apple has updated its data collection consent prompts to require opt-in for third-party apps, following criticism from German authorities. The policy aims to address concerns over cross-app tracking and user preferences.",
